@host=https://tile-expert-test.local

### Number of orders per day (default), first page
GET {{host}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json

### Per month, 12 groups per page, biggest groups first
GET {{host}}/api/orders?group_by=month&per_page=12&page=1&sort=count desc
Accept: application/json

### Per year, oldest first
GET {{host}}/api/orders?group_by=year&sort=group asc
Accept: application/json

### Per day in a date range (both days are inclusive)
GET {{host}}/api/orders?group_by=day&start_day=2026-11-01&end_day=2026-11-30
Accept: application/json

### Second page of 5 groups
GET {{host}}/api/orders?per_page=5&page=2
Accept: application/json

### Invalid group_by -> 422
GET {{host}}/api/orders?group_by=week
Accept: application/json

### Invalid page and per_page -> 422
GET {{host}}/api/orders?page=0&per_page=1001
Accept: application/json

### Invalid date -> 422
GET {{host}}/api/orders?start_day=yesterday
Accept: application/json
